span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.469" end="00:43.048"><span begin="00:40.469" end="00:40.649">I </span><span begin="00:40.649" end="00:41.019">bought </span><span begin="00:41.019" end="00:41.359">my </span><span begin="00:41.359" end="00:41.768">fake </span><span begin="00:41.768" end="00:42.448">ID </span><span begin="00:42.448" end="00:42.818">for </span><span begin="00:42.818" end="00:43.048">you </span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.638" end="00:46.138"><span begin="00:43.638" end="00:43.878">She </span><span begin="00:43.878" end="00:44.228">told </span><span begin="00:44.228" end="00:44.658">me </span><span begin="00:44.658" end="00:45.068">to </span><span begin="00:45.068" end="00:45.458">meet </span><span begin="00:45.458" end="00:45.818">her </span><span begin="00:45.818" end="00:46.138">there </span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.818" end="00:49.068"><span begin="00:46.818" end="00:46.978">I </span><span begin="00:46.978" end="00:47.358">can't </span><span begin="00:47.358" end="00:48.058">afford </span><span begin="00:48.058" end="00:48.328">the </span><span begin="00:48.328" end="00:48.808">bus </span><span begin="00:48.808" end="00:49.068">fare </span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.688" end="00:51.748"><span begin="00:49.688" end="00:49.928">I'm </span><span begin="00:49.928" end="00:50.318">not </span><span begin="00:50.318" end="00:50.668">old </span><span begin="00:50.668" end="00:51.298">enough </span><span begin="00:51.298" end="00:51.508">for </span><span begin="00:51.508" end="00:51.748">her </span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.138" end="00:54.168"><span begin="00:52.138" end="00:52.368">I </span><span begin="00:52.368" end="00:52.918">just </span><span begin="00:52.918" end="00:53.348">hate </span><span begin="00:53.348" end="00:53.608">not </span><span begin="00:53.608" end="00:54.008">being </span><span begin="00:54.008" end="01:01.391">eighteen </span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.391" end="01:03.380"><span begin